Definitions.
- In this Act, unless, the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Commission" means "The State Commission for the Scheduled Castes" constituted under section 3;
(b)
"Member" means a member of the Commission and includes the Chairman and the Vice Chairman of the Commission;
(c)
"Scheduled Castes" shall have the meaning assigned in clause (24) of Article 366 of the Constitution of India;
